The treemap layout follows the squarified algorithm as published by Bruls,
Huizing and van Wijk (2000) and as implemented in d3-hierarchy (ISC). No code
was taken from any GPL-licensed disk analyzer.

Five transitive dependencies are MPL-2.0, all of them reached only through
Tauri and so present only in the desktop app, never in `storage-core` or the
`sv` CLI (verified with `cargo tree -p storage-core` and `-p storage-cli`,
which report none):

  option-ext           via dirs-sys <- dirs <- tauri            (runtime)
  cssparser            via dom_query <- tauri-utils <- tauri-build
  cssparser-macros     via cssparser
  dtoa-short           via cssparser
  selectors            via dom_query <- tauri-utils <- tauri-build

